91 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 64 0 R
/E (Validation Scope: Hardware deployment \(STM32\) exists solely to test whether the ESN algorithm is deployable in a real-time, low-power setting, it is a feasibility check, not the project's end product. Success is defined by algorithmic accuracy and efficiency, not by the hardware demo itself)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
